  "body": "Specifically, if you specify a display name of `[benpa]` then that will cause the `contains_display_name` to match against the regex `(^|\\W)[benpa](\\W|$)`, which matches any event with the word \"a\" in it.\r\n\r\nThis is because we pass the display name straight into `_glob_matches` and the glob to regex conversion doesn't escape regex characters in the glob. (We also probably don't want to be using display name as a glob)",
